OL,3,CBristol Airport suspends all flights
OL,4,Cover runway defect
OL,6,FAll flights out of Bristol Airport
OL,7,Fhave been suspended until at least 6am
OL,8,Ftomorrow (Saturday 8 August) because
OL,9,Fof a "runway defect"
OL,11,FBosses say the closure is
OL,12,Fprecautionary and will allow engineers
OL,13,Fto inspect and repair the section
OL,14,Faffected.
OL,16,FIn a statement on its website, a
OL,17,FBristol Airport spokesperson said:
OL,18,F"Due to a defect on the runway, we
OL,19,Fhave temporarily suspended operations
OL,20,Fas a precaution, in order to inspect
OL,21,Fand repair the section affected.
