OL,3,CBristol Airport suspends all flights
OL,4,Cover runway defect
OL,6,F"We apologise for any inconvenience.
OL,7,FSafety is always our number one
OL,8,Fpriority. Customers should refer to
OL,9,Ftheir airlines with any flight queries.
OL,11,F"All flights are currently suspended
OL,12,Funtil at least 06:00 tomorrow morning
OL,13,F(Saturday 8 August)."
